#: ../../source/use-case-guide/maximize-microsoft-investments.rst:2
msgid "Maximize Your Microsoft Investments"
msgstr "Microsoft 투자 극대화"

#: ../../source/use-case-guide/maximize-microsoft-investments.rst:4
msgid ""
"Unlock the full potential of your Microsoft Teams, M365, and Entra ID "
"investment with Mattermost. Designed for operational teams that require "
"advanced customization, secure workflows, and seamless deployment on "
"segregated networks, Mattermost enhances your existing Microsoft "
"solutions for critical mission success."
msgstr ""
"OKR.BEST로 Microsoft Teams, M365, Entra ID 투자의 잠재력을 최대한 끌어내세요. 고급 "
"커스터마이징, 안전한 워크플로, 분리된 네트워크로의 매끄러운 배포가 필요한 운영 팀을 위해 "
"설계된 OKR.BEST는 기존 Microsoft 솔루션을 보강하여 핵심 임무의 성공을 돕습니다."

#: ../../source/use-case-guide/maximize-microsoft-investments.rst:6
msgid ""
"Mattermost complements Microsoft solutions with tailored capabilities "
"designed to meet the unique needs of high-security environments, inter-"
"agency collaboration, and external workflows, enabling teams to maximize "
"their Microsoft investment."
msgstr ""
"OKR.BEST는 고보안 환경, 기관 간 협업, 외부 워크플로의 고유한 요구에 맞춘 기능으로 "
"Microsoft 솔루션을 보완하여, 팀이 Microsoft 투자를 최대한 활용할 수 있게 합니다."

#: ../../source/use-case-guide/maximize-microsoft-investments.rst:8
msgid "The following mission-ready collaboration capabilities are available:"
msgstr "다음과 같은 미션 레디 협업 기능을 사용할 수 있습니다:"

#: ../../source/use-case-guide/maximize-microsoft-investments.rst:11
msgid "Sovereign Communication in Microsoft Teams"
msgstr "Microsoft Teams 안의 주권 커뮤니케이션"

#: ../../source/use-case-guide/maximize-microsoft-investments.rst:13
msgid ""
"Agencies and critical infrastructure organizations must often comply with"
" strict data sovereignty rules that restrict cloud usage for sensitive "
"collaboration."
msgstr ""
"정부 기관과 핵심 인프라 조직은 민감한 협업에 클라우드 사용을 제한하는 엄격한 데이터 주권 "
"규정을 준수해야 하는 경우가 많습니다."

#: ../../source/use-case-guide/maximize-microsoft-investments.rst:15
#: ../../source/use-case-guide/maximize-microsoft-investments.rst:44
#: ../../source/use-case-guide/maximize-microsoft-investments.rst:59
#: ../../source/use-case-guide/maximize-microsoft-investments.rst:75
#: ../../source/use-case-guide/maximize-microsoft-investments.rst:87
msgid "**Benefits**"
msgstr "**이점**"

#: ../../source/use-case-guide/maximize-microsoft-investments.rst:17
msgid ""
"**Deploy Mattermost on-premise or in sovereign clouds**, fully integrated"
" with Microsoft Teams and Outlook (See :doc:`Mattermost for M365, Teams, "
"and Outlook </integrations-guide/mattermost-mission-collaboration-"
"for-m365>`) to maintain workflow continuity and secure data storage."
msgstr ""
"**OKR.BEST를 온프레미스 또는 주권 클라우드에 배포** — Microsoft Teams 및 Outlook과 "
"완전히 통합되어(:doc:`Mattermost for M365, Teams, and Outlook "
"</integrations-guide/mattermost-mission-collaboration-for-m365>` 참고) "
"워크플로 연속성과 안전한 데이터 저장을 유지합니다."

#: ../../source/use-case-guide/maximize-microsoft-investments.rst:18
msgid ""
"**Store messages, recordings, and transcriptions in compliance-approved "
"systems**, with :ref:`data-at-rest encryption <security-guide/security-"
"guide-index:data-at-rest encryption>` ensuring no leakage of sensitive "
"data to third-party platforms."
msgstr ""
"**메시지, 녹음, 전사 내용을 컴플라이언스 승인 시스템에 저장** — :ref:`저장 데이터 암호화 "
"<security-guide/security-guide-index:data-at-rest encryption>`\\ 로 민감한 "
"데이터가 제3자 플랫폼으로 유출되지 않도록 보장합니다."

#: ../../source/use-case-guide/maximize-microsoft-investments.rst:19
msgid ""
"**Enable secure Microsoft Teams interactions via embedded Mattermost "
"collaboration**, supporting operations within familiar interfaces while "
"enforcing regulatory compliance. See :doc:`Mattermost for M365, Teams, "
"and Outlook </integrations-guide/mattermost-mission-collaboration-"
"for-m365>`."
msgstr ""
"**내장된 OKR.BEST 협업으로 안전한 Microsoft Teams 상호작용 지원** — 익숙한 인터페이스 "
"안에서 작업하면서도 규제 컴플라이언스를 강제합니다. :doc:`Mattermost for M365, Teams, "
"and Outlook </integrations-guide/mattermost-mission-collaboration-"
"for-m365>` 문서를 참고하세요."

#: ../../source/use-case-guide/maximize-microsoft-investments.rst:20
msgid ""
"**Enforce agency-specific policies** with :doc:`legal hold "
"</administration-guide/comply/legal-hold>`, :doc:`retention policies "
"</administration-guide/comply/data-retention-policy>`, and :doc:`user "
"access controls </administration-guide/onboard/advanced-permissions>` "
"that align with national or sectoral mandates."
msgstr ""
"**기관별 정책 강제** — 국가·부문별 규정에 맞춘 :doc:`리걸 홀드 "
"</administration-guide/comply/legal-hold>`, :doc:`보존 정책 "
"</administration-guide/comply/data-retention-policy>`, :doc:`사용자 접근 통제 "
"</administration-guide/onboard/advanced-permissions>`\\ 를 적용합니다."

#: ../../source/use-case-guide/maximize-microsoft-investments.rst:23
msgid "On-Premises Skype for Business Replacement"
msgstr "온프레미스 Skype for Business 대체"

#: ../../source/use-case-guide/maximize-microsoft-investments.rst:25
msgid ""
"As Skype for Business reaches end-of-life, secure organizations require "
"an alternative that preserves on-premises control, integrates into "
"Microsoft workflows, and meets the security standards of air-gapped and "
"classified environments. Cloud-first replacements like Microsoft Teams "
"are not always viable due to network segmentation, compliance "
"restrictions, or data sovereignty mandates."
msgstr ""
"Skype for Business가 지원 종료(EOL)에 이르면서, 보안이 중요한 조직에는 온프레미스 "
"통제력을 유지하고, Microsoft 워크플로에 통합되며, 에어갭·기밀 환경의 보안 표준을 "
"충족하는 대안이 필요합니다. Microsoft Teams 같은 클라우드 우선 대체재는 네트워크 분리, "
"컴플라이언스 제약, 데이터 주권 규정 때문에 항상 도입 가능한 것은 아닙니다."

#: ../../source/use-case-guide/maximize-microsoft-investments.rst:27
msgid ""
"Extend Microsoft Enterprise IT investments for edge-based, highly "
"tailored Mission IT workflows with Mattermost."
msgstr ""
"OKR.BEST로 Microsoft 엔터프라이즈 IT 투자를 엣지 기반의 고도로 맞춤화된 임무 IT "
"워크플로로 확장합니다."

#: ../../source/use-case-guide/maximize-microsoft-investments.rst:30
msgid ""
"**Preserve mission-critical communication workflows** with a self-hosted "
"Mattermost deployment that supports :doc:`1:1 calls </end-user-"
"guide/collaborate/make-calls>`, :ref:`screen sharing <end-user-"
"guide/collaborate/make-calls:share your screen>`, and :doc:`threaded "
"messaging </end-user-guide/collaborate/organize-conversations>` within "
"secure environments."
msgstr ""
"**미션 크리티컬한 커뮤니케이션 워크플로 보존** — 보안 환경 안에서 :doc:`1:1 통화 "
"</end-user-guide/collaborate/make-calls>`, :ref:`화면 공유 "
"<end-user-guide/collaborate/make-calls:share your screen>`, :doc:`스레드 메시징 "
"</end-user-guide/collaborate/organize-conversations>`\\ 을 지원하는 셀프 호스팅 "
"OKR.BEST 배포를 활용합니다."

#: ../../source/use-case-guide/maximize-microsoft-investments.rst:31
msgid ""
"**Integrate Mattermost with Microsoft tools** such as Outlook, Teams, and"
" :doc:`Entra ID Single Sign-On </administration-guide/onboard/sso-"
"entraid>` to retain user workflows while centralizing identity and access"
" control. See :doc:`Mattermost for M365, Teams, and Outlook "
"</integrations-guide/mattermost-mission-collaboration-for-m365>`."
msgstr ""
"**OKR.BEST와 Microsoft 도구 통합** — Outlook, Teams, :doc:`Entra ID 싱글 사인온 "
"</administration-guide/onboard/sso-entraid>`\\ 과 통합해 사용자 워크플로를 유지하면서 "
"신원·접근 통제를 중앙화합니다. :doc:`Mattermost for M365, Teams, and Outlook "
"</integrations-guide/mattermost-mission-collaboration-for-m365>` 문서를 "
"참고하세요."

#: ../../source/use-case-guide/maximize-microsoft-investments.rst:32
msgid ""
"**Deploy in sovereign, air-gapped, or private cloud environments** such "
"as `Azure Deployment <https://azuremarketplace.microsoft.com/en-"
"us/marketplace/apps/mattermost.mattermost-operator?tab=overview>`_ or "
"**Azure Local** (formerly Azure Stack HCI) for on-premises hybrid cloud "
"scenarios while maintaining compliance with STIG, FedRAMP, and NIST "
"800-53 standards. For Azure Local deployments, we recommend engaging "
"**Mattermost Professional Services** for deployment support. `Talk to an "
"Expert <https://mattermost.com/contact-sales/>`_ to learn more."
msgstr ""
"**주권·에어갭·프라이빗 클라우드 환경에 배포** — STIG, FedRAMP, NIST 800-53 표준을 "
"준수하면서 `Azure 배포 <https://azuremarketplace.microsoft.com/en-"
"us/marketplace/apps/mattermost.mattermost-operator?tab=overview>`_ 또는 "
"온프레미스 하이브리드 클라우드 시나리오를 위한 **Azure Local**(구 Azure Stack HCI)에 "
"배포할 수 있습니다. Azure Local 배포 시에는 **Mattermost Professional Services**\\ 의 "
"배포 지원을 받는 것을 권장합니다. 자세한 내용은 `전문가와 상담 "
"<https://mattermost.com/contact-sales/>`_\\ 하세요."

#: ../../source/use-case-guide/maximize-microsoft-investments.rst:34
msgid ""
":doc:`Learn more </use-case-guide/on-prem-skype-for-business-"
"replacement>` about replacing Skype for Business with Mattermost."
msgstr ""
"Skype for Business를 OKR.BEST로 대체하는 방법을 :doc:`자세히 알아보세요 "
"</use-case-guide/on-prem-skype-for-business-replacement>`."

#: ../../source/use-case-guide/maximize-microsoft-investments.rst:37
msgid "Out-of-Band Incident Response for Microsoft-Centric Environments"
msgstr "Microsoft 중심 환경을 위한 대역 외 인시던트 대응"

#: ../../source/use-case-guide/maximize-microsoft-investments.rst:39
msgid ""
"During high-stakes incidents, Microsoft 365 tools can be limited or "
"unavailable, slowing down response times and jeopardizing mission "
"continuity."
msgstr ""
"중대한 인시던트 상황에서는 Microsoft 365 도구가 제한되거나 사용 불가능해져 대응 시간이 "
"느려지고 임무 연속성이 위협받을 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/use-case-guide/maximize-microsoft-investments.rst:41
msgid ""
"Self-hosted Mattermost collaboration embeds in Microsoft Teams and "
"Outlook user experience, while storing data all messaging, audio and "
"screen share recordings, transcriptions, file sharing and AI interactions"
" in fully on-premise data stores."
msgstr ""
"셀프 호스팅 OKR.BEST 협업이 Microsoft Teams와 Outlook 사용자 경험에 내장되며, 모든 "
"메시징, 오디오·화면 공유 녹음, 전사, 파일 공유, AI 상호작용 데이터를 완전한 온프레미스 "
"데이터 저장소에 보관합니다."

#: ../../source/use-case-guide/maximize-microsoft-investments.rst:46
msgid ""
"**Maintain operational continuity during M365 outages** with a dedicated,"
" out-of-band Mattermost instance for secure incident response, "
"communication, and collaboration. See :doc:`Mattermost Mission "
"Collaboration for Microsoft </integrations-guide/mattermost-mission-"
"collaboration-for-m365>`"
msgstr ""
"**M365 중단 시에도 운영 연속성 유지** — 안전한 인시던트 대응, 커뮤니케이션, 협업을 위한 "
"전용 대역 외 OKR.BEST 인스턴스를 운영합니다. :doc:`Mattermost Mission Collaboration "
"for Microsoft </integrations-guide/mattermost-mission-collaboration-"
"for-m365>` 참고"

#: ../../source/use-case-guide/maximize-microsoft-investments.rst:47
msgid ""
"**Accelerate responses** with :doc:`AI-powered workflows "
"</administration-guide/configure/agents-admin-guide>`, enabling "
"structured playbooks for triage, escalation, and resolution even when "
"primary systems are compromised."
msgstr ""
"**대응 가속화** — :doc:`AI 기반 워크플로 "
"</administration-guide/configure/agents-admin-guide>`\\ 로 주 시스템이 침해된 "
"상황에서도 분류, 에스컬레이션, 해결을 위한 구조화된 플레이북을 활용할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/use-case-guide/maximize-microsoft-investments.rst:48
msgid ""
"**Integrate with Microsoft Security Suite** and :doc:`Entra ID "
"</administration-guide/onboard/sso-entraid>` to preserve centralized "
"identity management while keeping sensitive data in a secure secondary "
"system. :doc:`Learn more </integrations-guide/integrations-guide-index>` "
"about Mattermost's integration capabilities."
msgstr ""
"**Microsoft Security Suite와 통합** — :doc:`Entra ID "
"</administration-guide/onboard/sso-entraid>`\\ 와 연계해 중앙화된 신원 관리를 "
"유지하면서 민감한 데이터는 안전한 보조 시스템에 보관합니다. OKR.BEST의 통합 기능을 "
":doc:`자세히 알아보세요 </integrations-guide/integrations-guide-index>`."

#: ../../source/use-case-guide/maximize-microsoft-investments.rst:49
msgid ""
"**Protect breach-sensitive notifications** using :ref:`ID-only push "
"alerts <administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings"
":id-only push notifications>` and enhanced mobile security, enabling "
"secure communication without cloud exposure."
msgstr ""
"**침해에 민감한 알림 보호** — :ref:`ID 전용 푸시 알림 "
"<administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings"
":id-only push notifications>`\\ 과 강화된 모바일 보안으로 클라우드 노출 없이 안전하게 "
"소통합니다."

#: ../../source/use-case-guide/maximize-microsoft-investments.rst:52
msgid "Enterprise to Tactical Edge"
msgstr "엔터프라이즈에서 전술 엣지까지"

#: ../../source/use-case-guide/maximize-microsoft-investments.rst:54
msgid ""
"Operational teams need to extend Microsoft capabilities to mission "
"environments where bandwidth is limited, systems are segregated, and "
"speed is critical."
msgstr ""
"운영 팀은 대역폭이 제한되고, 시스템이 분리되어 있으며, 속도가 중요한 임무 환경으로 "
"Microsoft 기능을 확장해야 합니다."

#: ../../source/use-case-guide/maximize-microsoft-investments.rst:56
msgid ""
"Secure, Mission-Focused Collaboration to Enable Faster, Informed "
"Decision-Making across Environments."
msgstr ""
"환경 전반에서 더 빠르고 정보에 기반한 의사 결정을 가능하게 하는 안전한 임무 중심 협업."

#: ../../source/use-case-guide/maximize-microsoft-investments.rst:61
msgid ""
"**Enable mission-critical coordination at the edge** by :ref:`deploying "
"Mattermost in secure, on-prem or air-gapped environments <deployment-"
"guide/server/server-deployment-planning:deployment options>` "
":doc:`integrated with Microsoft Teams and Outlook </integrations-guide"
"/mattermost-mission-collaboration-for-m365>`."
msgstr ""
"**엣지에서의 미션 크리티컬 협조 지원** — :doc:`Microsoft Teams 및 Outlook과 통합 "
"</integrations-guide/mattermost-mission-collaboration-for-m365>`\\ 된 상태로 "
":ref:`보안·온프레미스·에어갭 환경에 OKR.BEST를 배포 <deployment-guide/server"
"/server-deployment-planning:deployment options>`\\ 합니다."

#: ../../source/use-case-guide/maximize-microsoft-investments.rst:62
msgid ""
"**Fuse data and decision-making across platforms** with support for "
":doc:`toolchain integration </integrations-guide/integrations-guide-"
"index>`, :doc:`audio/screen share </end-user-guide/collaborate/make-"
"calls>`, and :doc:`workflow automation </end-user-guide/workflow-"
"automation>` embedded into a dedicated Mission Operations Platform."
msgstr ""
"**플랫폼 간 데이터와 의사 결정 융합** — 전용 임무 운영 플랫폼에 내장된 :doc:`툴체인 통합 "
"</integrations-guide/integrations-guide-index>`, :doc:`오디오/화면 공유 "
"</end-user-guide/collaborate/make-calls>`, :doc:`워크플로 자동화 "
"</end-user-guide/workflow-automation>`\\ 를 지원합니다."

#: ../../source/use-case-guide/maximize-microsoft-investments.rst:63
msgid ""
"**Maintain coalition and partner alignment** through :doc:`interoperable "
"Connected Workspaces </administration-guide/onboard/connected-"
"workspaces>` supporting collaboration across mission partner networks."
msgstr ""
"**연합·파트너 공조 유지** — 임무 파트너 네트워크 간 협업을 지원하는 :doc:`상호 운용 "
"가능한 연결된 워크스페이스 </administration-guide/onboard/connected-workspaces>`\\ 를 "
"활용합니다."

#: ../../source/use-case-guide/maximize-microsoft-investments.rst:64
msgid ""
"**Accelerate action with mission-tuned AI** using secure Azure AI and "
":doc:`Mattermost Copilot </end-user-guide/agents>` to summarize context, "
"guide decisions, and automate operational tasks."
msgstr ""
"**임무에 맞춘 AI로 행동 가속화** — 안전한 Azure AI와 :doc:`OKR.BEST Copilot "
"</end-user-guide/agents>`\\ 으로 컨텍스트를 요약하고, 의사 결정을 안내하고, 운영 작업을 "
"자동화합니다."

#: ../../source/use-case-guide/maximize-microsoft-investments.rst:65
msgid ""
"**Secure every communication path** with built-in :doc:`Zero Trust "
"controls </security-guide/zero-trust>` and deploy on Azure or sovereign "
"environments for maximum flexibility and compliance."
msgstr ""
"**모든 커뮤니케이션 경로 보호** — 내장된 :doc:`제로 트러스트 통제 "
"</security-guide/zero-trust>`\\ 를 적용하고 Azure 또는 주권 환경에 배포하여 유연성과 "
"컴플라이언스를 극대화합니다."

#: ../../source/use-case-guide/maximize-microsoft-investments.rst:68
msgid "External Collaboration with Full Control"
msgstr "완전한 통제력을 갖춘 외부 협업"

#: ../../source/use-case-guide/maximize-microsoft-investments.rst:70
msgid ""
"Managing external collaboration within Microsoft Teams can be complex, "
"often requiring numerous configurations and administration that lead to "
"security risks like usage of consumer-grade chat tools."
msgstr ""
"Microsoft Teams 안에서 외부 협업을 관리하는 일은 복잡할 수 있으며, 수많은 설정과 관리 "
"작업이 필요해 일반 소비자용 채팅 도구 사용 같은 보안 위험으로 이어지곤 합니다."

#: ../../source/use-case-guide/maximize-microsoft-investments.rst:72
msgid ""
"Mattermost replaces Signal, Discord and other free personal apps with "
"secure external messaging controlled by IT."
msgstr ""
"OKR.BEST는 Signal, Discord 등 무료 개인용 앱을 IT 부서가 통제하는 안전한 외부 메시징으로 "
"대체합니다."

#: ../../source/use-case-guide/maximize-microsoft-investments.rst:77
msgid ""
"**Integrate Mattermost with Microsoft Teams and Outlook** to enable "
"secure external collaboration with encryption, audit trails, and role-"
"based permissions—without compromising compliance. (See :doc:`Mattermost "
"for M365, Teams, and Outlook </integrations-guide/mattermost-mission-"
"collaboration-for-m365>`)."
msgstr ""
"**OKR.BEST와 Microsoft Teams·Outlook 통합** — 암호화, 감사 추적, 역할 기반 권한을 갖춘 "
"안전한 외부 협업을 컴플라이언스 저해 없이 지원합니다. (:doc:`Mattermost for M365, "
"Teams, and Outlook </integrations-guide/mattermost-mission-collaboration-"
"for-m365>` 참고)."

#: ../../source/use-case-guide/maximize-microsoft-investments.rst:78
msgid ""
"**Eliminate shadow IT** by providing :doc:`Connected Workspaces "
"</administration-guide/onboard/connected-workspaces>` for sanctioned, "
"policy-enforced engagement with external partners—reducing reliance on "
"consumer-grade tools."
msgstr ""
"**섀도 IT 제거** — 외부 파트너와의 승인된 정책 기반 협력을 위한 :doc:`연결된 워크스페이스 "
"</administration-guide/onboard/connected-workspaces>`\\ 를 제공하여 일반 소비자용 "
"도구 의존도를 낮춥니다."

#: ../../source/use-case-guide/maximize-microsoft-investments.rst:79
msgid ""
"**Apply granular policy enforcement for external users**, including "
":ref:`granular user permissions <administration-guide/manage/team-"
"channel-members:advanced access controls>`, :doc:`legal hold "
"</administration-guide/comply/legal-hold>`, :doc:`retention policies "
"</administration-guide/comply/data-retention-policy>`, and :doc:`custom "
"Terms of Service </administration-guide/comply/custom-terms-of-service>`."
msgstr ""
"**외부 사용자에 대한 세분화된 정책 적용** — :ref:`세분화된 사용자 권한 "
"<administration-guide/manage/team-channel-members:advanced access "
"controls>`, :doc:`리걸 홀드 </administration-guide/comply/legal-hold>`, "
":doc:`보존 정책 </administration-guide/comply/data-retention-policy>`, "
":doc:`사용자 정의 서비스 약관 "
"</administration-guide/comply/custom-terms-of-service>`\\ 을 포함합니다."

#: ../../source/use-case-guide/maximize-microsoft-investments.rst:80
msgid ""
"**Synchronize user identity** using :doc:`Entra ID </administration-"
"guide/onboard/sso-entraid>` to maintain scalable, centralized access "
"control across both internal and external collaborators."
msgstr ""
"**사용자 신원 동기화** — :doc:`Entra ID "
"</administration-guide/onboard/sso-entraid>`\\ 로 내부·외부 협업자 전반에 걸쳐 확장 "
"가능하고 중앙화된 접근 통제를 유지합니다."

#: ../../source/use-case-guide/maximize-microsoft-investments.rst:83
msgid "Cross-Instance Collaboration Hub"
msgstr "인스턴스 간 협업 허브"

#: ../../source/use-case-guide/maximize-microsoft-investments.rst:85
msgid ""
"Multi-agency, multi-tenant Microsoft 365 environments often hinder "
"seamless collaboration and increase complexity for inter-organization "
"workflows."
msgstr ""
"다기관·다중 테넌트 Microsoft 365 환경은 매끄러운 협업을 방해하고 조직 간 워크플로의 "
"복잡성을 높이는 경우가 많습니다."

#: ../../source/use-case-guide/maximize-microsoft-investments.rst:89
msgid ""
"**Centralize communication across M365 instances** using Mattermost as a "
"neutral, embedded hub for messaging, file sharing, and playbook "
"coordination (See :doc:`Mattermost for M365, Teams, and Outlook "
"</integrations-guide/mattermost-mission-collaboration-for-m365>`)."
msgstr ""
"**M365 인스턴스 간 커뮤니케이션 중앙화** — OKR.BEST를 메시징, 파일 공유, 플레이북 "
"조율을 위한 중립적 내장 허브로 활용합니다(:doc:`Mattermost for M365, Teams, and "
"Outlook </integrations-guide/mattermost-mission-collaboration-for-m365>` "
"참고)."

#: ../../source/use-case-guide/maximize-microsoft-investments.rst:90
msgid ""
"**Bridge segmented Teams deployments** with :doc:`Connected Workspaces "
"</administration-guide/onboard/connected-workspaces>` and Microsoft "
"presence integration to ensure continuity without duplicative "
"configuration."
msgstr ""
"**분리된 Teams 배포 연결** — :doc:`연결된 워크스페이스 "
"</administration-guide/onboard/connected-workspaces>`\\ 와 Microsoft 프레즌스 "
"통합으로 중복 설정 없이 연속성을 보장합니다."

#: ../../source/use-case-guide/maximize-microsoft-investments.rst:91
msgid ""
"**Deploy flexibly across hybrid, private, or air-gapped environments** "
"such as :doc:`Mattermost for M365, Teams, and Outlook </integrations-"
"guide/mattermost-mission-collaboration-for-m365>` to ensure operational "
"consistency no matter the deployment complexity."
msgstr ""
"**하이브리드·프라이빗·에어갭 환경에 유연하게 배포** — :doc:`Mattermost for M365, "
"Teams, and Outlook </integrations-guide/mattermost-mission-collaboration-"
"for-m365>` 같은 구성으로 배포 복잡도와 관계없이 일관된 운영을 보장합니다."

#: ../../source/use-case-guide/maximize-microsoft-investments.rst:92
msgid ""
"**Secure external communications and maintain control** with "
"segmentation, data governance, and compliance automation across Teams "
"ecosystems."
msgstr ""
"**외부 커뮤니케이션 보호와 통제 유지** — Teams 생태계 전반에 걸친 분리, 데이터 거버넌스, "
"컴플라이언스 자동화를 제공합니다."

#: ../../source/use-case-guide/maximize-microsoft-investments.rst:95
msgid "Get Started"
msgstr "시작하기"

#: ../../source/use-case-guide/maximize-microsoft-investments.rst:97
msgid ""
"We can help you maximize your Microsoft investment while extending its "
"capabilities into the most demanding mission contexts. `Book a live demo "
"<https://mattermost.com/request-demo/>`_  or `talk to a Mattermost expert"
" <https://mattermost.com/contact-sales/>`_ to discover how your "
"organization can enhance Microsoft-based workflows with secure, "
"extensible collaboration tailored for operational and compliance-"
"sensitive environments. Or try Mattermost yourself with a `1-hour preview"
" <https://mattermost.com/sign-up/>`_ for instant access to a live sandbox"
" environment."
msgstr ""
"가장 까다로운 임무 환경으로 기능을 확장하면서 Microsoft 투자를 극대화하도록 "
"도와드립니다. `라이브 데모를 예약 <https://mattermost.com/request-demo/>`_\\ 하거나 "
"`Mattermost 전문가와 상담 <https://mattermost.com/contact-sales/>`_\\ 하여 "
"운영·컴플라이언스 민감 환경에 맞춘 안전하고 확장 가능한 협업으로 Microsoft 기반 "
"워크플로를 강화하는 방법을 알아보세요. 또는 `1시간 미리보기 "
"<https://mattermost.com/sign-up/>`_\\ 를 통해 라이브 샌드박스 환경에 즉시 접속하여 "
"Mattermost를 직접 사용해 볼 수 있습니다."

